# Project spec

Normative specification of what `dxx` **is**, what each component **must do**, and which invariants the project enforces. Companion documents: [`project-guide.mkd`](project-guide.mkd) (how to work in the repo), [`project-structure.mkd`](project-structure.mkd) (where things live), [`spec-commits.mkd`](spec-commits.mkd) (commit format).

Throughout: **MUST** / **MUST NOT** / **SHOULD** / **MAY** have their usual (RFC-2119-ish) force. Sections marked _[status]_ record the gap between spec and current implementation; those are the authoritative to-do list, not aspirational prose.

